---
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <p class="text-gold font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-sm mb-3">August 22, 2026</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-midnight mb-6">The Starting Grid Awaits</h2>
      <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-red mx-auto"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Two column layout -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Text -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-lg text-slate leading-relaxed">
          The world of motorsport has always been synonymous with glamour, precision, and
          high-octane excitement. Now, that electrifying energy meets the elegance of a
          world-class black-tie gala — the <strong class="text-midnight">Pre-Prix 250</strong>, a
          fusion of Grand Prix sophistication and unforgettable nightlife.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate leading-relaxed">
          Pre-Prix 250 is the black-tie gala of <a href="/freedom-250-grand-prix-evening" class="text-red font-semibold hover:underline">Freedom 250 Grand Prix weekend</a> &mdash;
          the first-ever INDYCAR race on a street circuit around the National Mall, August 22&ndash;23, 2026.
          Saturday: the gala. Sunday: the race.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate leading-relaxed">
          On August 22, the <strong class="text-midnight">iconic Washington Hilton will transform into
          a racing-inspired wonderland</strong> — a Monaco-meets-D.C. spectacle featuring
          immersive racing decor, world-class entertainment, premium open bars, and culinary
          experiences that rival the finest pit-lane hospitality suites in the world.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate leading-relaxed">
          This is the inaugural <span class="font-bold uppercase">Pre-Prix 250</span> — a brand-new
          tradition where 3,000 guests will gather in the nation's capital for a night of speed,
          style, and celebration unlike anything Washington has ever seen.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-midnight">
          Be there when the green flag drops.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Image -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-xl aspect-[4/3]">
          <img
            src="/images/event/countdown-toast.png"
            alt="Guests raising champagne glasses during the midnight countdown"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover scale-[1.02]"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-32 h-32 bg-midnight/10 rounded-lg -z-10"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
